---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "../components/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<Layout title="About SBMA" description="Learn about the Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority, the governing body of the Subic Bay Freeport Zone.">
  <section aria-label="About SBMA hero" class="bg-primary-500 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="mb-4 inline-block border border-white/20 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white/70">Government Partner</div>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-6xl">Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/70">The governing body of the Subic Bay Freeport Zone</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Breadcrumb pages={[{ label: "About Us", href: "/about-sbdmc" }, { label: "About SBMA" }]} />

  <section aria-label="SBMA mandate and functions" class="py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          The Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority (SBMA) is the government agency responsible for the development and management of the Subic Bay Freeport Zone (SBFZ). Established in 1992 after the departure of the US military from Subic Bay Naval Base, the SBMA has successfully transformed the area into one of the Philippines' most successful economic zones.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Mandate</h2>
      <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500 mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          SBMA's mandate includes the administration, operation, and development of the Subic Bay Freeport Zone as a self-sustaining industrial, commercial, financial, and investment center.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Key Functions</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Investment Promotion</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Attracting and facilitating investments within the freeport zone.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Developing and maintaining world-class infrastructure and facilities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Environmental Mgmt</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Environmental protection and sustainable development programs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="SBMA benefits for locators" class="bg-primary-500 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-white" data-aos="fade-up">
        Locators within SBGP benefit from the favorable business climate and incentives offered by the SBMA, including tax holidays, duty-free imports, and streamlined business registration processes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
